e all the  officers in action  since i have been deputy mayor i  continue to be grateful  for all their work and patience which if  it didn't happen  the morality would not be able to  function  a huge thank you to all our officers  and can i finish we live in strange  times because of the pandemic  but these strange times will not last  forever we will get through this and i'm  sure by the end of my 18 months  term of office we will have become  stronger  and more caring of our fellow citizens  in trafford  thank you everybody and we hope you have  an enjoyable  annual general meeting this evening  thank you  lord of wisdom  we ask your blessing upon lawrence walsh  as mayor during this year and on all  the members of trafford council  teach us all to walk in your ways so  that our actions  may give you glory may we desire to  witness to others  your love so that they may draw closer  to you  take from us whatever hinders us  from adhering to your word  creating us that desire to serve others  and in doing so to serve you  lord our world desperately needs models  of truth and integrity  people of honor who attest their lives  to your goodness  may we always seek to be persons who  inspire others to faithful obedience of  that  which jesus taught us  help our council leaders to follow those  who've begun this good work  those men and women who before us were  determined to advance  jesus mission of healing the teaching of  caring for the poor  guide us to be your light  so that we may all witness to others  your truth and your life and we ask this  through jesus christ our lord  amen and so may almighty god bless you  in keeping his love in his care  and help you to become the people you  can be  and the blessing of the father and the  son  and the holy spirit amen
 

